"All documents in the assigned set were accepted in the envelope response. "
"This confirms the submitted documents; it does not record the separate "
"postulation progress decision made in the SII portal."
msgstr ""
"Esto confirma los documentos enviados; no registra la decisión separada "
"sobre el avance de la postulación que se realiza en el portal del SII."

#. module: l10n_cl_dte_certification
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cl_dte_certification.certification_set_view_form
msgid ""
"In the portal, choose “Declarar Avance de la Postulación” and enter the "
"TrackID and submission date above. If SII shows “En revisión”, wait for its "
"decision. After approval, open the dossier, complete its entry evidence, "
"then use the assigned-set stage to run preflight and register the official "
"SII result from the SETMAIL email. Acceptance moves the dossier to "
"Simulation."
msgstr ""
